@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam padding 4
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceParticipant underline

'────────────────── Participants ──────────────────
actor "Submitter"             as U
participant "React Wizard UI" as UI
database   "Supabase-\nPostgres"          as DB
participant ":core_svc\nFastAPI"          as API
participant ":dynamic-fields_svc"         as DFS
participant ":ai_svc\n(OpenAI + pgvector)" as AIS
participant "Realtime WS"      as WS
participant "Supervisor UI"    as SUP

'────────────────── Step 0 – Login & Dashboard ─────────────
U  -> UI  : Sign in (OAuth)
UI -> UI  : show Dashboard\n(+ New Idea)

'────────────────── Step 1 – Category Select ───────────────
U -> UI  : click +New Idea
UI -> UI  : Step-1 modal\nrender category chips
U  --> UI : select one or more tags
UI -> DFS : POST /dynamic-fields\n{ categories }
DFS --> UI : JSON schema for extra fields
UI -> UI  : render Step-2+3 forms\ndynamically

'────────────────── Step 2 – Describe & Dynamic Fields ─────
U  --> UI : fill title, description
U  --> UI : fill ROI / TRL / tCO₂e …\n(based on schema)
UI -> UI  : client-side validation (zod)

'────────────────── Step 3 – Review & Submit ───────────────
U  -> UI  : click **Submit Idea**
UI -> API : POST /ideas\n(payload incl. cat + fields)
activate API

  '───────── 3a AI Tag Suggest & Dup Check ───────────
  API -> AIS : classify_tags + embed
  AIS --> API : tags[], confidence, embedding
  API -> DB  : INSERT idea, embedding, status=CAPTURED
  API -> AIS : SELECT id FROM idea\nORDER BY embedding <-> ? LIMIT 1
  AIS --> API : possible_duplicate_id | null

  '───────── 3b Save + Broadcast ─────────────────────
  API -> DB : UPDATE idea\nSET ai_confidence, primary_tag
  API -> WS : emit change over channel
deactivate API
API --> UI  : 201 Created + idea JSON

'────────────────── Step 4 – Wizard Success ────────────────
UI -> UI  : show toast “Idea captured”
UI -> UI  : navigate to Idea Detail\nStatus = **CAPTURED**
UI <-- WS : change event ⇒ status=SCREENED (later)

'────────────────── Downstream: Supervisor Line-up ─────────
note over API, SUP
  *If* primary_tag includes REGULATORY_COMPLIANCE  
  🌐 API adds idea to Reg-Ops queue;  
  else → Standard Evaluation queue.
end note

WS --> SUP : push idea in queue
SUP -> SUP : reviewer opens card → approve/reject
SUP -> API : POST /ideas/{id}/approve
API -> DB  : status=APPROVED
WS --> UI  : toast “Idea approved 🎉”

@enduml